###2026.03.26.03
- Fix: Restored the missing `folder.editor.icon-api.js` dependency on the folder editor page so member reordering and any other folder save path no longer fail in the modern editor with `Cannot read properties of null (reading 'securePost')`.
- Regression guard: The modern folder editor bootstrap now treats the icon API helper as a required module and the editor smoke coverage checks that the page ships it before runtime save handlers execute.


###2026.03.26.02
