- Fix: Keep the modern folder editor shell hidden behind the loading placeholder until runtime hydration completes, so existing-folder edits no longer flash the blank generic shell first.
- Fix: Reveal the modern editor stage only after runtime-ready or on bootstrap failure, which preserves diagnostics while removing the intermediate empty-state repaint during normal loads.


###2026.03.25.70
