- Quality: Rebuild the packaged dev archive and smoke guards around the mode-scoped modern editor root.


###2026.03.25.69
- Fix: Render the modern folder editor through its own visible stage while keeping the legacy scaffold hidden, so the legacy form no longer flashes before the modern editor hydrates.
- Fix: Stop legacy runtime left-alignment overrides from applying to modern editor rows, which keeps modern field cards and section spacing under the modern layout contract.
- Quality: Load folder editor styles after the host theme and lock the modern-stage/scaffold split into the editor smoke guards.


